    ex:requirementIdentifier "RF-61" ;
    ex:requirementStatement "All parameterized data, gradients or updates transmitted outside the local scope must use pseudonymous or anonymized identifiers. Direct personal identifiers must not accompany parameterized data, gradients or federated updates, and a violation query must be available to detect any breach of this rule." ;
