    ex:requirementIdentifier "RF-63" ;
    ex:requirementStatement "The delegation event must record the source, destination, cause, start of validity and recovery condition. `validTo` must represent the effective closure of the delegation and may remain unset while it is active. If a planned expiration differs from the actual closure, it must be represented by an additional explicit temporal limit rather than ambiguously reusing `validTo`." ;
    ex:tracedToMechanism ex:M-DELEG-01,
        ex:M-TIME-01 ;
    ex:tracedToPolicy ex:P-AUD-02 .

