    ex:requirementStatement "The system must close or invalidate a delegation when the source node's recovery condition is met or its planned expiration is reached. At that point, it must record `validTo` as the effective closure time." ;
    ex:tracedToMechanism ex:M-DELEG-02 ;
    ex:tracedToPolicy ex:P-AUD-03 .

