ex:RF-47 a ex:FunctionalRequirement,
        ex:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-47" ;
    ex:definedInArtifact ex:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    ex:requirementIdentifier "RF-47" ;
    ex:requirementStatement "Node selection must first apply eligibility constraints for availability, connectivity, consent, zone and minimum capacity. Among eligible nodes, the system must prioritize those with higher trust and avoid saturated, unstable or historically unreliable nodes." ;
    ex:tracedToMechanism ex:M-ADAPT-02,
        ex:M-AUD-01,
        ex:M-CONS-02,
        ex:M-NODE-02,
        ex:M-TRUST-02,
        ex:M-ZONE-01 ;
    ex:tracedToPolicy ex:P-NODE-02,
        ex:P-NODE-05,
        ex:P-NODE-06 .

ex:RF-48 a ex:FunctionalRequirement,
        ex:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-48" ;
    ex:definedInArtifact ex:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    ex:requirementIdentifier "RF-48" ;
    ex:requirementStatement "Every delegation must preferentially select, among eligible destinations, the node with the highest trust compatible with load, availability, connectivity, residual capacity and active constraints. The destination is not required to have a higher trust score than the source node when the source degradation has a cause other than trust." ;
    ex:tracedToMechanism ex:M-ADAPT-02,
        ex:M-AUD-01,
        ex:M-DELEG-01,
        ex:M-NODE-02,
        ex:M-TRUST-02 ;
    ex:tracedToPolicy ex:P-ADAPT-07,
        ex:P-NODE-05,
        ex:P-NODE-06 .

ex:RF-55 a ex:FunctionalRequirement,
        ex:Requirement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "RF-55" ;
    ex:definedInArtifact ex:RequirementsArtifact_Revised ;
    ex:requirementIdentifier "RF-55" ;
    ex:requirementStatement "The system must warn about or invalidate an AHP evaluation when weights are not normalized, when the trust weight is included in AHP normalization or when AHP judgment inconsistency exceeds the configured threshold. The ontology must explicitly represent the consistency metric/ratio and the applied threshold; if pairwise comparisons and consistency checking are not used, the mechanism must be documented as weighted multicriteria scoring rather than AHP." ;
    ex:tracedToMechanism ex:M-MODEL-02,
        ex:M-MODEL-03,
        ex:M-TRUST-02 ;
    ex:tracedToPolicy ex:P-MODEL-02,
        ex:P-MODEL-03,
        ex:P-MODEL-04 .

